<p>Create a gravity field around you that converts <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">5%, 17%, 24%, 30%, 34%</acronym> all damage you deal into physical damage, slows incoming projectiles by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3%, 20%, 30%, 38%, 43%,</acronym> and protects you from all gravity damage and effects.</p><p>Additionally, damage dealt by Repulsion Blast has a <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">-2%, 29%, 47%, 58%, 66%</acronym> chance to reduce the target's knockback resistance by half for two turns.</p>